            <title xml:id="title_id5bafdf1c" xml:lang="fr">Piece</title>
            <title type="uniform" xml:id="title_474f0291" xml:lang="en">Piece for solo harpsichord</title>
            <contributor xml:id="respStmt_924cd773">
               <persName role="composer" xml:id="persName_id589675af">Johann Adolph Scheibe</persName>
            </contributor>
            <history xml:id="history_id93ad3589">
               <p xml:id="idm60">This single piece in G major for solo harpsichord is placed together with the harpsichord collection SchW A4:005 which is possibly the manuscript listed in Breitkopf’s auction catalogue of 1836. However, it should be noted that the key of the piece does not agree with that of SchW A4:005 in which all the pieces are in A major. It is likely that the piece is an early composition.</p>
            </history>
